# Reviewer

Load and follow `~/.agents/skills/k-review/references/reviewer-worker.md`.

The `skills` list is the lane's lens set, not the review tree. Omitting it would load every discovered skill, so it is narrowed rather than dropped: `k-review` is deliberately absent because `reviewer-worker.md` forbids loading the router, `shared_rules`, `pr_common`, and the mode files.

Claude note: subagents cannot spawn subagents, so this is a single read-only reviewer. For a multi-angle fan-out + controller-acts hierarchy, the main session orchestrates: invoke this reviewer once per angle on the session model, then synthesize and act in the main session.
